cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use KubeIntellect in your research or product, please cite it as below."
title: "KubeIntellect: An LLM-Driven Autonomous Operator for Kubernetes"
abstract: >-
  KubeIntellect is an autonomous, memory-augmented operator for Kubernetes that
  investigates live clusters with real tools (kubectl, Prometheus, Loki), grounds its
  answers in evidence, and applies fixes behind human-in-the-loop approval. It features a
  tiered-reasoning multi-agent architecture and a persistent memory hierarchy (episodes,
  a temporal knowledge graph, and reflexion with verified-fix promotion) that lets it make
  increasingly accurate decisions across sessions.
type: software
